  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="11">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref> 11</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ eac ic beode eallum minum gerefum, be minum freondscype ⁊ be eallum þam þe hi agon ⁊ be heora agenum life, þæt hy æghwær min folc rihtlice healdan ⁊ rihte domas deman be ðære scira biscopa gewitnesse, ⁊ swylce mildheortnesse þæron don swylce þære scire biscope riht þince ⁊ se man acuman mæge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And likewise I enjoin upon all my reeves, under pain of forfeiting my friendship and all that they possess and their own lives, to govern my people justly everywhere, and to pronounce just judgments with the cognisance of the bishops of the dioceses, and to inflict such mitigated penalties as the bishop may approve and the man himself may be able to bear.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
